	(property "Description" "LCDWIKI ES3C28P UART socket P2 on a JST PH B4B-PH-K-S header, 2.0mm, pins 1:1. Pin 1 5V: the ES3C28P's +5 rail through its MOSFET Q5, out while the board runs, in when driven; with no USB-C VBUS, 5V driven here reaches a cell on the battery socket; leave open, power through ES3C28P_PWR. Pin 2 GND. Pin 3 TXD: ES3C28P output, GPIO43 (U0TXD) through 100 Ohm. Pin 4 RXD: ES3C28P input, GPIO44 (U0RXD) through 100 Ohm. UART0, 3.3V logic. From the LCDWIKI schematic and outline drawing."
